
ls   --> to list the directories and files  in current directory


ls /var   --> to list the directories and files in var directory


ls -l   --> to list in long format


ls -a   -->  Show all files, including hidden files (starting with .).


ls -lh  -->  Long listing with human-readable file sizes (KB, MB, GB).


ls -t   --> to list in timely order


ls -r   --> to list in reverse order


ls -ltr  --> to list in long, timely and reverse order


ll --> long list


ls -R  --> Recursively list all directories and subdirectories.


ls -d */ --> List only directories.


ls -1  -->  Display one file per line.


ls -lS   --> sort by size

